<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Chaos Engineering Report - {{ ansible_date_time.date }}</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #1a1a1a; color: #e0e0e0; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 36px; }
        .header p { margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; }
        .summary { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .card { background: #2a2a2a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; }
        .card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #667eea; }
        .events { background: #2a2a2a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .event { background: #3a3a3a; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #ff6b6b; }
        .event h4 { margin: 0 0 5px 0; color: #ff6b6b; }
        .event p { margin: 5px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #888; }
        .chaos-score { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; color: #ff6b6b; }
        .apocalypse { font-size: 24px; color: #ff6b6b; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🚨 Chaos Engineering Report 🚨</h1>
        <p>Generated on {{ ansible_date_time.date }} at {{ ansible_date_time.time }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="summary">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Total Chaos Score</h3>
            <div class="chaos-score">{{ apocalypse_score }}/100</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Chaos Events</h3>
            <div style="font-size: 32px;">{{ chaos_results | length }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Target Host</h3>
            <div>{{ inventory_hostname }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Chaos Duration</h3>
            <div>{{ chaos_duration }} seconds</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="events">
        <h2>Chaos Events Executed</h2>
        {% for event in chaos_results %}
        <div class="event">
            <h4>{{ event.description }}</h4>
            <p><strong>Impact:</strong> {{ event.impact }}</p>
            <p><strong>Apocalypse Points:</strong> {{ event.apocalypse_points }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div class="apocalypse">🎭 May your systems be resilient! 🎭</div>
        <p>This report was generated by the Nightly Ansible Chaos Orchestrator</p>
        <p>Remember: With great chaos comes great responsibility!</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
